blurb = "The Haven in Worlds Upon The Wind is composed of many elements directly taken or inspired by that artwork.

Although not an ukiyo-e print but rather an e-maki (painted scroll), this artwork does an amazing job of illustrating life in the Edo period and the themes presented by ukiyo-e and Worlds Upon The Wind."
